A Guzzle HTTP Message Assistant (HTTP MAs) extension that adds support for the [Guzzle HTTP Message](https://github.com/guzzle/guzzle) library.

## Installation

Install the extension using Composer:

```bash
composer require michael-kot/guzzle-http-message-assistant
```

## Usage

Add the following code to your `config.php` file:

```php
return [
    'http_message_assistant' => [
        'class' => 'MikeKot\GuzzleHttp\Message\Assistant',
    ],
];
```

Then you can use the `Assistant` class to interact with the Guzzle HTTP Message library. For example:

```php
use GuzzleHttp\Message\MessageInterface;
use GuzzleHttp\Message\MessageFactory;
use GuzzleHttp\Message\ResponseInterface;
use GuzzleHttp\Message\Uri;

$message = MessageFactory::createFromString('{"foo":"bar","baz":{"type":"string"}}');
$response = $message->send();

$

